{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paragliding Simulator</strong> delivers the ultimate free-flight experience. Developed by an experienced paragliding pilot, it accurately recreates the dynamics of flight with soft-body wing physics and dynamic winds\u2014offering endless possibilities for exploration and skill-building gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wings:</strong> Choose from a wide range of wings right from the start, from nimble speed wings to high-aspect racing gliders. With the built-in wing editor, you can even design and fine-tune your own custom wing from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harnesses:</strong> Mix and match any harness with any wing\u2014whether it\u2019s a lightweight setup, a powered paramotor, or a trike. For even more variety, try fun options like the kiting buggy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349300/extras/88047e87fca295743a29517ce149ae2d.avif?t=1757098633\" width=1024 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winds:</strong> From soaring to long-distance thermal cross-country flights, anything is possible. Adjust your wind settings, and the simulator will accurately generate ridge lift, rotor, and thermals for realistic flight conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349300?t=1757098633","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349300?t=1757098633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349300/d9b8d588ab5cdfb6163af95b3144cb4907d7e979/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757098633","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349300/d9b8d588ab5cdfb6163af95b3144cb4907d7e979/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757098633","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paragliding Simulator</strong> delivers the ultimate free-flight experience. Developed by an experienced paragliding pilot, it accurately recreates the dynamics of flight with soft-body wing physics and dynamic winds\u2014offering endless possibilities for exploration and skill-building gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wings:</strong> Choose from a wide range of wings right from the start, from nimble speed wings to high-aspect racing gliders. With the built-in wing editor, you can even design and fine-tune your own custom wing from scratch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harnesses:</strong> Mix and match any harness with any wing\u2014whether it\u2019s a lightweight setup, a powered paramotor, or a trike. For even more variety, try fun options like the kiting buggy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349300/extras/88047e87fca295743a29517ce149ae2d.avif?t=1757098633\" width=1024 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winds:</strong> From soaring to long-distance thermal cross-country flights, anything is possible. Adjust your wind settings, and the simulator will accurately generate ridge lift, rotor, and thermals for realistic flight conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Evan Burrows"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349300/header.jpg?t=1757098633","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>